[{:adr/authoritative_for ["cnc->org-iso-6983、brep->org-iso-10303 のrename決定と根拠" "brep.step（ISO 10303-21 STEP物理ファイルreader/writer）の実装スコープ" "この2件がADR-2607083200のCAE 6リポジトリと異なる扱いを受ける理由"], :adr/supersedes [], :adr/contrast-with-cae-batch "ADR-2607083200's 6 CAE repos (aero/crash/motor/vphysics/echem/cae-solver) did NOT get reverse-domain names because they are clean-room, homegrown reduced-order models -- no external spec/regulatory body governs them. This ADR's 2 repos DID get reverse-domain names because format/vocabulary-level conformance to a real ISO standard was verified first (not assumed). Same decision framework, applied consistently to both outcomes.", :adr/superseded_by [], :adr/topic "kotoba-lang-cad-cam-integration", :adr/related ["adr-2607083200-kami-engine-cae-rename-batch" "adr-2607083900-brep-cnc-engineering-capability"], :adr/status "accepted", :adr/id "adr-2607084200-brep-cnc-iso-conformance-rename", :adr/doc_type "adr", :adr/dependent-updates "[{:repo \"orgs/kotoba-lang/kami-engine-vehicle-designer\", :change \"deps.edn coordinates io.github.kotoba-lang/{brep,cnc} -> io.github.kotoba-lang/{org-iso-10303,org-iso-6983}; no src/ change (Clojure namespaces brep.*/kotoba.cam.* unchanged)\", :merge-commit \"74c5e8058299ae19e9edc83a3f4e1d84aeb295a5\"}]", :adr/last_verified "2026-07-08", :adr/renames "[{:old \"kotoba-lang/cnc\", :new \"kotoba-lang/org-iso-6983\", :reason \"kotoba.cam.gcode's G/M-code vocabulary (G00/G01/G02/G03/G21/G90/M03/M05/M06/M08/M09/M30) IS ISO 6983-1 (RS274D, ISO-standardized 1980) -- same org-iso-* bar as org-iso-jpeg/org-iso-h264 (real format conformance)\", :merge-commit \"e1998926e70c3707b2dcb751df0f1380dd86c0bc\"} {:old \"kotoba-lang/brep\", :new \"kotoba-lang/org-iso-10303\", :reason \"brep.kernel's vertex/edge/face/shell/solid topology matches ISO 10303-42's model directly; brep.step (new) reads/writes real ISO 10303-21 physical files -- renamed only after implementing this, not before\", :merge-commit \"36d50ebe65d07e4ba5714388c8863e7dfa98becc\", :prerequisite-work \"brep.step/write-step+read-step, verified against steptools.com's reference AP203 sample block.stp; scope PLANE/LINE only (make-box), make-cylinder refused not silently mis-exported; correctness via round-trip fidelity\"}]", :adr/deciders ["Jun Kawasaki"], :adr/date "2026-07-08", :db/id -1, :adr/authoritative true, :adr/title "kotoba-lang/cnc を org-iso-6983 へ、kotoba-lang/brep を org-iso-10303 へrename — 実際に規格に準拠していることを確認した上での reverse-domain 命名"}]